      "id": "claim_68d9edbef4954987b7b0a440c89a26f2",
      "statement": "DBProcedureUtil is the central Oracle database access utility that executes stored procedures, managing connection acquisition from the HikariCP pool, JDBC parameter binding (input and output), and resource cleanup.",
